                    <mxGeometry x="940" y="188" width="160" height="24" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="legend_notes" value="Notes:&#10;1. Active-HIGH Scanning: Outputs are pulsed HIGH one by one.&#10;2. Input Configuration: Columns PA0, PA1, PA3, PA4, PA5 must enable internal pull-downs (PULLDOWN).&#10;3. SYSCFG Analog Switches for PA0_C (Pin 20) and PA1_C (Pin 22) must be closed in CM4 GPIO Init.&#10;4. Strobe 1 Pin 37 (PC6) must be removed from the Cortex-M7 GPIO Init list to avoid core conflict.&#10;5. Disable DAC1 on Cortex-M7 in the firmware so PA4 and PA5 are not driven to analog state." style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;resizable=0;points=[];strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=10;fontColor=#8B949E;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="700" y="222" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/>
